Nomad Highlands.text:
{{Biome Infobox
| images = Nomad Highlands.png
| description = The '''Nomad Highlands''' is a biome of limestone bluffs high above the Shroud.
| level = <div style= "text-align:center">'''Biome Level'''<br>15 - 20</div>
| flamelevel = <div style= "text-align:center">'''Req. [[Flame Level]]'''<br>4</div>
| connectedbiomes = <div style= "text-align:center">'''Connected Biomes'''<br>[[Springlands]]<br>[[Revelwood]]<br>[[Kindlewastes]]<br>[[Albaneve Summits]]</div>
}}

The '''Nomad Highlands''' is a biome of limestone bluffs high above the Shroud. Its major features include the '''Pillars of Creation''', two massive volcanos connected to the Ancients, and '''Umber Hollow''', a low region of dense Shroud in the center of the Highlands.

It is located in the center of the [[Map|map]] and connected to the [[Springlands]] to the south-west, the [[Revelwood]] to the north-west, the [[Kindlewastes]] to the east, and the [[Albaneve Summits]] to the north.

