| description = The '''Albaneve Summits''' is a frozen mountainous biome.
| level = <div style= "text-align:center">'''Biome Level'''<br>30 - 40</div>
| flamelevel = <div style= "text-align:center">'''Req. [[Flame Level]]'''<br>6 - 8</div>
| connectedbiomes = <div style= "text-align:center">'''Connected Biomes'''<br>[[Nomad Highlands]]<br>[[Kindlewastes]]<br>[[Veilwater Basin]]<br>[[Cinder’s Cradle]]</div>
}}

The '''Albaneve Summits''' is a frozen mountainous biome added in the [[Souls Of The Frozen Frontier Update]]. It is dominated by '''Howling Peak''' - the highest point in [[Embervale]] - where a [[Fell Dragon Youngling|dangerous corrupted beast]] lurks.

It is located in the northeast of the [[Map|map]] and connected to the [[Nomad Highlands]], the [[Kindlewastes]] to the south, the [[Veilwater Basin]] to the west, and the [[Cinder’s Cradle]] to the south.

