Veilwater Basin.text:
{{Biome Infobox
| images = Veilwater Basin Lore.png
| description = The '''Veilwater Basin''' is biome of tropical lakes and sandy beaches.
| level = <div style= "text-align:center">'''Biome Level'''<br>35 - 45</div>
| flamelevel = <div style= "text-align:center">'''Req. [[Flame Level]]'''<br>8-9</div>
| connectedbiomes = <div style= "text-align:center">'''Connected Biomes'''<br>[[Revelwood]]<br>[[Albaneve Summits]]<br>[[Cinder’s Cradle]]</div>
}}

The '''Veilwater Basin''' is a biome of tropical lakes and sandy beaches added in the [[Wake Of Water Update]]. Its lakes, formed by meltwater from the [[Albaneve Summits]], are the largest remaining sources of surface water uncorrupted by the [[Shroud]].

It is located in the center of the [[Map|map]] between the [[Blackmire]] and the [[Albaneve Summits]], is connected to the [[Revelwood]] to the south, the [[Albaneve Summits]] to the east, and the [[Cinder’s Cradle]] to the southeast.

